  "prefLabel": "He-E 806.33 Per Diem Rates and Payment for Nursing Care",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-E 806.33 Per Diem Rates and Payment for Nursing Care.\n\n(a) An NF shall be reimbursed for direct and indirect costs as determined by the bed days of care and the NF’s prospective per diem rate.\n\n(b) Payment rates shall be pursuant to the provisions of He-E 806.\n\nSource. #8547, eff 1-24-06 (formerly He-W 593.35); ss by #10474, 1-24-14; ss by #14020, eff 7-10-24",
